  "releaseNotes": "Documentation Updates:\n\t\t- Modifies XML summary for ExportFilterImagesToDisk to clarify its usage.\n\t\tDependency Updates:\n\t\t- Updates IronSoftware.System.Drawing to 2025.5.3.\n\t\tBug Fixes:\n\t\t- Fixes ReadPdf returning wrong page number when reading multiple PDFs.\n        - Fixes an issue where ExportFilterImagesToDisk did not create any files in the specified directory.\n\t\tNew Features:\n\t\t- Adds a new method called ReadPdfs for reading multiple PDFs. The method will return a BarcodeResults object for each PDF document.\n\t\t- Adds HistogramEqualization, Erode, and Dilate filters for barcode image pre-processing in ImageFilterCollection.\n\t\tEnhancements:\n\t\t- Improves reading performance with the \"ExtremeDetail\" Speed mode.",
